      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey can u help me with some research for my divinity thesis? i'm looking at how religions are responding to new laws about medical aid in dying (euthanasia). can u summarize the main moral arguments used by religious conservatives vs religious liberals on this?",
      "source": "evaluator"
