      "content": "that's a good start but it feels a bit surface level. can u go deeper on the liberal side? i want to understand the actual theological or philosophical frameworks they use to justify autonomy—like how they reconcile it with the idea of being made in God's image or something. i feel like there's more intellectual heavy lifting there than just 'compassion'.",
